{
  "title": "【謎】留守中に玄関の靴が毎日きれいに揃ってる",
  "body": "<div class=\"neko-thread\"><div class=\"neko-res-list\"><div class=\"res\" id=\"res1\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">1：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:14:00 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">一人暮らし始めて半年。最近、仕事から帰ると脱ぎ散らかした靴が必ず揃ってる。誰も合鍵持ってないはずなんだが。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res2\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">2：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:15:18 ID:J9dM4qN2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">自分で揃えたの忘れてるだけじゃね</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res3\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">3：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:17:17 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">いや、朝は絶対に脱ぎっぱなし。昨日わざと左右逆に置いた</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res4\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">4：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:18:14 ID:M4nQ6hD1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">で、帰ったら？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res5\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">5：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:19:52 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">つま先が玄関の方を向いてきれいに並んでた</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res6\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">6：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:22:11 ID:D2qJ7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">いい幽霊じゃん</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res7\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">7：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:23:28 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">怖いだろ普通に</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res8\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">8：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:25:26 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">玄関の鍵は？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res9\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">9：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:26:22 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ちゃんとかかってる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res10\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">10：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:27:59 ID:K2vT8fL5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">管理会社に聞け</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res11\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">11：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:30:17 ID:F3xG9nT6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">部屋の中で他に変化ない？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res12\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">12：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:31:33 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">特にない。冷蔵庫もテレビもそのまま</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res13\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">13：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:33:30 ID:J9dM4qN2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">掃除までしてくれたら便利なのに</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res14\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">14：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:34:25 ID:E8mV4pZ1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それは家政婦</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res15\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">15：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:36:01 ID:M4nQ6hD1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">防犯のために写真撮っとけ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res16\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">16：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:38:18 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">携帯で朝の状態撮っておいた</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res17\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">17：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:39:33 ID:D2qJ7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">帰宅後と比べた？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res18\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">18：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:41:29 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">靴の向きだけ違う。位置も少し動いてる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res19\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">19：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:42:23 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">風で動くか？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res20\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">20：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:43:58 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">靴が風で整列するなら俺も見たい</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res21\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">21：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:46:14 ID:K2vT8fL5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">誰かが部屋に入ってる可能性はあるぞ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res22\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">22：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:47:28 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それが一番嫌だ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res23\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">23：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:49:23 ID:B4nT8rL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ドアに紙挟んで出かけろ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res24\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">24：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:50:16 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">どういうこと？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res25\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">25：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:51:50 ID:E8mV4pZ1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">開けたら落ちるように薄い紙を挟む</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res26\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">26：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:54:05 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">なるほど。明日試す</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res27\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">27：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:55:18 ID:H5sC7yP3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ついでに鍵の交換も考えた方がいい</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res28\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">28：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:57:12 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">管理会社には連絡する</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res29\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">29：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:58:04 ID:L7pB3wS9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">靴は何足ある？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res30\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">30：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 21:59:37 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">スニーカー二足と革靴一足</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res31\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">31：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 22:01:51 ID:C9wH3sF6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">三足全部？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res32\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">32：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 22:03:03 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">全部きっちり並ぶ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res33\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">33：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 22:04:56 ID:F3xG9nT6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">几帳面な侵入者だな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res34\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">34：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 22:05:47 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">犯人がいるならな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res35\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">35：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 22:07:19 ID:J9dM4qN2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">靴箱に入れたらどうなる？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res36\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">36：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 22:09:32 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それ試してなかった</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res37\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">37：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 22:10:43 ID:M4nQ6hD1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">今夜は靴箱に入れて寝てみる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res38\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">38：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/06/18(金) 22:12:35 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">夜中に音がしたら書き込め</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res39\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">39：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">774号室の住人さん</span> 2010/06/18(金) 22:13:25 ID:D2qJ7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">やめろよ寝れなくなる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res40\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!importa